# Google Maps key for WEB (used by GoogleMap.create) and as the on/off signal
# for showing the map on Android/web. iOS uses Apple Maps and needs no key.
# Copy this file to `.env`. For Android you must ALSO set the same key as
# MAPS_API_KEY in android/gradle.properties (the native SDK reads the manifest).
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
